# QR redirect layer (Cloudflare Pages).
# Printed QR codes encode https://theacaiclub.com/qr/<slug>. The destination is
# resolved HERE at scan time, so a printed code can be repointed anytime by
# editing one line and redeploying — the physical print never changes.
# Use 302 (temporary) so destinations are never cached as permanent.
#
# Specific slugs first; the /qr/* fallback below catches any unmapped/future slug
# so a code can never 404 (it still downloads the app).

/qr/app           /get                      302
/qr/run-club      /get?target=run-club      302
/qr/beaconsfield  /get?target=beaconsfield  302
/qr/reading       /get?target=reading       302
/qr/datchet       /get?target=datchet       302

/qr/*             /get                      302
